@startuml
skinparam lifelineStrategy solid
autonumber
title Diagrama Historial 1: GET /api/v1/supervisor/reports/transport-orders/revision-history

actor "Supervisor / Auditor" as User
participant "App Web (Frontend)" as Web
participant "Gateway Controller" as Gateway
participant "Revision History Service" as Service
participant "transport_orders DB" as OrdersDB
participant "routes & trucks DB" as RouteTruckDB
participant "count_sessions DB\n(transport_order_count_sessions)" as SessionDB
participant "truck_inventories DB" as InvDB

User -> Web: Aplica filtros en cabecera (Fecha, Camión, Chofer, Supervisor, Ruta, Estado)
Web -> Gateway: GET /api/v1/supervisor/reports/transport-orders/revision-history\n?startDate=2026-08-20&endDate=2026-08-25\n&truckPlate=2890-UIP&driverId=1024&supervisorId=98&status=WITH_DISCREPANCIES
Gateway -> Service: getRevisionHistoryList(filterDto)

Service -> OrdersDB: 1. findOrdersByDateAndFilters(filterDto)
OrdersDB --> Service: ordersList[] (ej. IDs: [100451, 100452])

Service -> RouteTruckDB: 2. findRoutesAndTrucks(orderIds)
RouteTruckDB --> Service: routesAndTrucksInfo[] (Chofer, Empresa, Placa, Tipo Camión)

Service -> SessionDB: 3. findCountSessionsByOrders(orderIds)
SessionDB --> Service: countSessions[] (DRIVER_INITIAL, SUPERVISOR_DISCREPANCY, SUPERVISOR_SEMAPHORE)

Service -> InvDB: 4. findInventorySummaries(orderIds)
InvDB --> Service: inventorySummaries[] (total_products, expected_qty, loaded_qty, net_variance)

Service -> Service: 5. computeGlobalPeriodKpis(ordersList, countSessions, inventorySummaries)
note right of Service
  Lógica en Memoria:
  - Total OTs despachadas en período
  - % Match Inicial Chofer (sin diferencias)
  - Total Revisiones de Supervisor
  - Total Auditorías Semáforo ejecutadas
end note

Service --> Gateway: 200 OK (PaginatedOrdersWithMetricsResponse)
Gateway --> Web: 200 OK JSON
Web --> User: Renderiza listado agrupado por fecha y tarjetas KPIs superiores
@enduml
